WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:03.088
Danny: Whoo boy!

2
00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:04.929
This is going to be good.

3
00:00:05.089 --> 00:00:13.452
Brad: I just have to connect this wire to the battery There, that's it.

4
00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:16.313
Danny: Will it work?

5
00:00:27.916 --> 00:00:32.519
Brad: Yes, if, as I expect, the nano-putty causes things to shrink.

6
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.781
Danny: It says so on the box!

7
00:00:36.322 --> 00:00:40.405
Brad: Well, I guess it should work then.

8
00:00:40.425 --> 00:00:42.287
Danny: Let's try it!

9
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:54.336
Danny: What about Tabby over there?

10
00:00:55.404 --> 00:00:55.824
Brad: No!

11
00:00:56.145 --> 00:00:58.326
What if what if something went wrong?

12
00:00:58.346 --> 00:01:00.527
Danny: Nothing will go wrong.

13
00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:02.148
You said it would work.

14
00:01:02.168 --> 00:01:04.069
Brad: Well, yes.

15
00:01:04.529 --> 00:01:16.296
Nothing should go wrong Let's test it on something that isn't alive.

16
00:01:17.457 --> 00:01:18.837
Danny: Fine.

17
00:01:19.618 --> 00:01:23.040
Brad: What about that umbrella?

18
00:01:25.388 --> 00:01:26.408
Danny: That's boring.

19
00:01:27.289 --> 00:01:28.729
But sure, go ahead.

20
00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:35.951
Brad: Something happened!

21
00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:45.273
Danny: I still can't see Brad: It's I think I see oh my!

22
00:01:45.293 --> 00:01:48.574
Danny: Wow!

23
00:01:49.294 --> 00:01:53.315
Danny: What went wrong?

24
00:01:53.335 --> 00:01:54.976
Brad: I don't know.

25
00:01:56.064 --> 00:01:58.766
Ah! The nano-streams must be crossed.

26
00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:03.750
Danny: So, instead of shrinking it Brad: It made it bigger.

27
00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:10.274
Brad: What should we try it on next?

28
00:02:10.294 --> 00:02:13.537
Danny: I still think the cat is a good idea.

29
00:02:13.557 --> 00:02:17.800
Brad: How about that plant?

30
00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.742
It's a living thing, but it's not my pet.

31
00:02:21.362 --> 00:02:23.584
Danny: Let me do it this time!

32
00:02:28.428 --> 00:02:29.469
Brad: That was better.

33
00:02:29.489 --> 00:02:32.131
Danny: There was less smoke this time.

34
00:02:32.151 --> 00:02:37.755
Brad: It's got polka dots.

35
00:02:37.775 --> 00:02:40.536
Danny: It's not smaller at all.

36
00:02:40.557 --> 00:02:44.980
Danny: I don't think this nano-putty works!

37
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.082
Brad: If my dad invented it, it works.

38
00:02:49.423 --> 00:02:51.344
Maybe I'm not doing something right.

39
00:02:51.364 --> 00:02:56.608
Danny: Still, it would be funny if the bullies were covered in polka dots.

40
00:02:58.776 --> 00:02:59.417
Danny: Hee-hee!

41
00:02:59.917 --> 00:03:03.900
They'd try to wash the dots off, but they wouldn't come off!

42
00:03:04.621 --> 00:03:05.281
Brad: Oops!

43
00:03:06.082 --> 00:03:06.803
Danny: What?

44
00:03:06.823 --> 00:03:10.706
Brad: I think this accidentally got in to the gun.

45
00:03:10.726 --> 00:03:16.550
Danny: How did that get in there?

46
00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.272
Brad: I don't know.

47
00:03:18.292 --> 00:03:22.355
Danny: You use pink polka-dotted Band-Aids?

48
00:03:22.815 --> 00:03:25.698
Ha-ha! Brad: I cut my finger.

49
00:03:26.578 --> 00:03:28.160
It was the only one I could find.

50
00:03:29.632 --> 00:03:30.092
Danny: Ha-ha!

51
00:03:30.613 --> 00:03:32.855
That's a Band-Aid for a baby girl!

52
00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:34.617
Brad: Don't laugh.

53
00:03:34.637 --> 00:03:35.978
Danny: Oooh.

54
00:03:36.338 --> 00:03:38.040
Did your mommy kiss it better?

55
00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.761
Brad: Stop teasing!

56
00:03:40.322 --> 00:03:42.144
No wonder the bullies don't like you.
